OL,3,GNEWSAStunned parents told to pay #1k
OL,4,Afor school buses
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents have said they felt like crying
OL,7,Fafter spotting that the cost of their
OL,8,Fchild's school bus passes would more
OL,9,Fthan double for the upcoming year.
OL,11,FThe cost for children on the 907
OL,12,FCentral Connect route from West
OL,13,FBergholt to The Stanway School in
OL,14,Fnearby Colchester has jumped from #405
OL,15,Fto #999.
OL,17,FCentral Connect said it had to increase
OL,18,Fcosts for these school transport
OL,19,Fservices - which it provides on behalf
OL,20,Fof Essex County Council - partly
OL,21,Fbecause of the universal increase in
OL,22,Ffuel prices.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
